{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれてから初めて見た夢 発売中！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いいたします(*ﾟｰﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの推し店舗もあり、感謝です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若を見つけてねーっ。うふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2017/05/26/7759634/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台 あさひなぐ 公演中！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮路真春ってどんな人だろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の中の宮路真春ってこんなイメージ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"僕の中の宮路真春はこんなイメージ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原作が漫画だからこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと人によって受け取り方が違うし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基盤はあれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな宮路真春がいると思うんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから私の演る宮路真春を押し付けたくないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、ただ1つの例でしかないことは確かです。原作のイメージはしっかりしたいのは勿論前提として考えてはいますが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も日々 試行錯誤です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、私なりに考えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3次元の舞台だからこそ 人間っぽさを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時折 敢えて強く出していたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャラクターに少し現実味を帯びさせてる部分があると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何より私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮路真春という人が好きだから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がどうのではなく宮路真春を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な人だと思って帰ってもらいたいから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい・強い・クール・恋に鈍感・薙刀バカ・ドライ・たまに天然 などなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな面がある宮路先輩ですが、そのどれか一面で終わるのには勿体無い人なのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんていう エゴを交えつつ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私なりに楽しく演らせてもらっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ続く公演、沢山の方に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんで頂けたらと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人から見れば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何ともないような小さな事で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩んで張り裂けそうになったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間の為に泣いたり、苦しんだり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青春って凄いですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2017/05/26/7759634/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの応援が嬉しい。本当に嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうね。"}],"source":"archive"}